## Project Structure

### Source Code (repository root)

```text
src/
├── models/
│   └── EmployeeAvailability.js          # NEW: Mongoose schema
├── app/
│   ├── api/
│   │   └── employees/
│   │       └── route.js                 # NEW: GET (auth) + POST (admin)
│   │       └── [id]/
│   │           └── route.js             # NEW: PUT (admin) + DELETE (admin)
